Measuring aid, off unless GM_GS_TIMING=<file> is set: one line per frame
handed to the host, "f commitID commit fence_done paint composited flushed"
(CLOCK_MONOTONIC ns), for the base plane's commit. commit is when the
client's wl_surface commit arrived, fence_done when its GPU work was done
(commit_t::present_time), paint when paint_all started, composited after
vulkan_wait (0 when not composited), flushed after wl_display_flush.

